From d0a0ed9b150d3fc8aacf4ab07b7f7d91264fe6d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] Remove bundled TextMate grammar integration
ABOUTME: Removes only the TextMate-backed syntax-highlighting defaults and dependencies from Terminal.Gui 2.4.17.
ABOUTME: Renames and hardens the temporary downstream package while preserving plain Markdown/code rendering.
---
diff --git a/ISLAMU-NOTICE.md b/ISLAMU-NOTICE.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..94097d2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/ISLAMU-NOTICE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+<!-- ABOUTME: Identifies the temporary ISLAMU downstream Terminal.Gui package and its exact upstream source. -->
+<!-- ABOUTME: Records the intentionally removed TextMate grammar integration and the return-to-upstream condition. -->
+
+# ISLAMU.Terminal.Gui
+
+This package is a temporary downstream build of Terminal.Gui `v2.4.17`,
+upstream commit `d0a0ed9b150d3fc8aacf4ab07b7f7d91264fe6d6`.
+
+ISLAMU removed the TextMateSharp grammar-backed syntax-highlighting
+implementation and its two package dependencies. Markdown and code-display
+views remain available with plain-text code rendering or a caller-supplied
+`ISyntaxHighlighter`.
+
+Terminal.Gui remains Copyright 2007-2011 Novell Inc and Copyright 2017
+Microsoft Corp under the included MIT license. This package is not an official
+tui-cs release. ISLAMU intends to return to an official dependency-clean
+modular release when one passes the project dependency gate.
